{"full":"XposedOrNot/XposedOrNot-API","name":"XposedOrNot-API","description":"Open-source API to check if an email has been exposed in a data breach and monitor breaches across your verified domains. Real-time alerts and breach analytics protect your online identity.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":98,"forks":9,"created":"2023-12-04T03:18:05Z","updated":"2026-10-05T00:24:40Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://api.xposedornot.com","topics":["ai-agents","api","breach-compilation","breach-detection","data-breach","databreach","gemini-cli-extension","mcp","mcp-server","model-context-protocol","osint","python","security","xposedornot"],"demo":"https://api.xposedornot.com/docs","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T16:57:12.437Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T16:57:12.437Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T16:57:12.437Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T16:39:34.007Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:18:12.851Z","stars":98,"forks":9},{"at":"2026-10-04T05:48:34.709Z","stars":98,"forks":9},{"at":"2026-10-05T16:57:12.437Z","stars":98,"forks":9}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["🎉 Your free API for real-time data breach monitoring and analytics.","Data breaches happen constantly, and most people only find out long after their email and passwords are already circulating. I built XposedOrNot so you don't have to wonder. Check an email or domain and know right away whether it's turned up in a known breach.","This repo is the API that powers it all: the breach lookups, the analytics, and the alerts. It's free to use, and it's open-source, so you can read exactly how every check works rather than taking my word for it."],"features":["Check whether an email has appeared in a known data breach, with stats on where and when","Check whether a password has been exposed without ever revealing your identity"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/XposedOrNot